# tinted-dircolors
# Scheme name: Digital Rain
# Scheme author: Nathan Byrd (https://github.com/cognitivegears)
# Template author: tinted-dircolors (local), modelled on seebi/dircolors-solarized
#
# Colors are 24-bit truecolor (38;2;R;G;B / 48;2;R;G;B) taken from the scheme,
# so they do not depend on the terminal's 16/256-color palette.
#
# Usage: eval "$(dircolors -b this-file)"

# Terminals that get colors at all
COLORTERM ?*
TERM Eterm
TERM ansi
TERM *color*
TERM con[0-9]*x[0-9]*
TERM cons25
TERM console
TERM cygwin
TERM *direct*
TERM dtterm
TERM gnome
TERM hurd
TERM jfbterm
TERM konsole
TERM kterm
TERM linux
TERM linux-c
TERM mlterm
TERM putty
TERM rxvt*
TERM screen*
TERM st
TERM terminator
TERM tmux*
TERM vt100
TERM vt220
TERM xterm*

